{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cards of Eternity: The Wheel of Time",
    "steam_appid": 2940620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/ce3a650eaf6f38647d93fd3833862c4f.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong><i>Unleash legendary heroes within Cards of Eternity and dive deep into the world of The Wheel of Time. </i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/169efd243745a1266a7606396018e97e.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><i><strong>Perfect strategic combat: collect, trade, and unleash powerful cards to outmaneuver opponents. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/39f6c7cd0567e8f853facfbfd5824ed6.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take part in journeys across mystical realms, participate in extreme PvP Battles, and summon companions to help your quest. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/b0e07ecb13d289613ccb7972ded484d1.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This high-fantasy CCG offers innovative features such as 2v2 play and a unique mode: The Gauntlet.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/8c4f4cd7fb6158a76d08732e161a5768.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> It promises to challenge veterans and newcomers alike with thrilling tactical gameplay in an epic universe created by Robert Jordan.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/02b8fc8ba5903c5ce6dcca4871cb6c78.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/ce3a650eaf6f38647d93fd3833862c4f.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong><i>Unleash legendary heroes within Cards of Eternity and dive deep into the world of The Wheel of Time. </i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/169efd243745a1266a7606396018e97e.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><i><strong>Perfect strategic combat: collect, trade, and unleash powerful cards to outmaneuver opponents. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/39f6c7cd0567e8f853facfbfd5824ed6.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take part in journeys across mystical realms, participate in extreme PvP Battles, and summon companions to help your quest. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/b0e07ecb13d289613ccb7972ded484d1.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This high-fantasy CCG offers innovative features such as 2v2 play and a unique mode: The Gauntlet.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/8c4f4cd7fb6158a76d08732e161a5768.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> It promises to challenge veterans and newcomers alike with thrilling tactical gameplay in an epic universe created by Robert Jordan.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940620/extras/02b8fc8ba5903c5ce6dcca4871cb6c78.avif?t=1744043063\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Cards of Eternity: The Wheel of Time is a strategic card game where players harness iconic characters, creatures, and the mystical forces of the One Power from the legendary fantasy world. Build decks, master unique abilities, and outplay opponents in dynamic, lore-rich battles.",
